     {
      "id": "a5864db",
      "elType": "widget",
      "widgetType": "heading",
      "isInner": false,
      "settings": {
       "title": "Product Photography &amp; Lookbook Shoots",
       "header_size": "h2",
       "mf_motion": "reveal"
      },
      "elements": []
     },
     {
      "id": "c605a5d",
      "elType": "widget",
      "widgetType": "text-editor",
      "isInner": false,
      "settings": {
       "editor": "<p>You just spent months making something beautiful. Don't let it die in bad lighting.</p><p>Our photography team treats your garments like art. Flat lays that stop the scroll. Model shots that make people ask \"where can I get that?\" Detail close-ups that prove you didn't cut corners.</p><p>No renting studios. No hunting for photographers. No \"can you just edit this to not look orange?\"</p><p>Just stunning images, ready for your website, your Instagram, your \"oh my god we launched\" moment.</p><p><strong>What you get:</strong></p><ul><li>Flat lays that actually sell</li><li>Real humans wearing your stuff</li><li>Close-ups that show off the stitching you're proud of</li><li>20-30 images that make you look like you've done this before</li></ul>",
       "__globals__": {
